ui/gtk: ASoftware's look: logo, window icon, side bar in iOS's dark style

The window icon is asoftware.png next to the executable (ASoftware's
logo; the QEMU icon when it is missing). With sidebar=on the side bar
follows the dark style of the iOS it shows: black, captioned groups of
rows as in Settings (Home and the keys that do the same on the right),
Install .ipa in blue and Shut down in red; the window and the Screen off
cover (0007, with the logo) are black, GTK prefers its dark theme for
menus and dialogs, and on Windows the title bar turns dark too
(DwmSetWindowAttribute, looked up at run time).
Based on QEMU v11.1.2 with 0002-0007.

